{"5149550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Keep to the Blue", "steam_appid": 5149550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The great storm has spat you out. Helpless, you cling to the wreckage of a ship — until you are finally rescued. But in this world, rescue is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep to the Blue</strong> is set in a harsh, post-apocalyptic world where the seas have swallowed the old civilization. Between scattered settlements, drifting wrecks, and dangerous waters, your new life at sea begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR SHIP IS YOUR HOME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with little more than a raft and work your way up to larger and more powerful vessels. Upgrade your ship, adapt it to your playstyle, and decide what kind of captain you want to become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heavily armed bulwark? A fast ship built for dangerous expeditions? Or perhaps a freighter for profitable trade routes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149550/extras/6c6db701126bc1f59808b9b67933d270.poster.avif?t=1788132577\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149550/extras/6c6db701126bc1f59808b9b67933d270.webm?t=1788132577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149550/extras/6c6db701126bc1f59808b9b67933d270.mp4?t=1788132577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT FOR VALUABLE LOOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are rarely alone on these waters. Face off against other ships, bring your weapons to bear, and fight for valuable loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you seize in one battle may make all the difference in the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149550/extras/7b2c1e20bbe4b003d77185d7bc8645f8.poster.avif?t=1788132577\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149550/extras/7b2c1e20bbe4b003d77185d7bc8645f8.webm?t=1788132577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149550/extras/7b2c1e20bbe4b003d77185d7bc8645f8.mp4?t=1788132577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VENTURE INTO THE UNKNOWN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the flooded world and uncover what lies hidden among the remains of the old civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the farther you stray from safer waters, the greater the danger becomes. Out there, pirates are waiting... <strong>and worse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149550/extras/ffaea1b459d026cc0d6fc627c39ad4b6.poster.avif?t=1788132577\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149550/extras/ffaea1b459d026cc0d6fc627c39ad4b6.webm?t=1788132577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5149550/extras/ffaea1b459d026cc0d6fc627c39ad4b6.mp4?t=1788132577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEEP TO THE BLUE!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The great storm has spat you out. Helpless, you cling to the wreckage of a ship — until you are finally rescued. But in this world, rescue is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep to t